:"40","sourcePageIndex":1,"sourceBlockIndex":14,"role":"question","text":"(17)（I） \\(\\displaystyle C(x,y)=20x+\\dfrac{\\displaystyle x^2}{\\displaystyle 4}+6y+\\dfrac{\\displaystyle y^2}{\\displaystyle 2}+10000\\) 。（II）若总产量为 50 件，则当甲种产品的产量为 24 件，乙种产品的产量为 26 件时，总成本最小，最小成本为 \\(\\displaystyle C(24,26)=11118\\) 万元。（III）当总产量为 50 件且总成本最小时，甲种产品的边际成本为 32 万元。其经济意义为：当甲、乙两种产品的产量分别为 24、26 件时，若甲种产品的产量再增加 1 件，则总成本增加 32 万元，即当乙种产品的产量为 26 件时，生产第 25 件甲种产品需要 32 万元。","contentHtml":"<div class=\"paragraph question\">(17)（I）<span class=\"formula\" data-tex=\"\\displaystyle C(x,y)=20x+\\dfrac{\\displaystyle x^2}{\\displaystyle 4}+6y+\\dfrac{\\displaystyle y^2}{\\displaystyle 2}+10000\" title=\"点击复制 LaTeX\">\\(\\displaystyle C(x,y)=20x+\\dfrac{\\displaystyle x^2}{\\displaystyle 4}+6y+\\dfrac{\\displaystyle y^2}{\\displaystyle 2}+10000\\)</span>。（II）若总产量为 50 件，则当甲种产品的产量为 24 件，乙种产品的产量为 26 件时，总成本最小，最小成本为 <span class=\"formula\" data-tex=\"\\displaystyle C(24,26)=11118\" title=\"点击复制 LaTeX\">\\(\\displaystyle C(24,26)=11118\\)</span> 万元。（III）当总产量为 50 件且总成本最小时，甲种产品的边际成本为 32 万元。其经济意义为：当甲、乙两种产品的产量分别为 24、26 件时，若甲种产品的产量再增加 1 件，则总成本增加 32 万元，即当乙种产品的产量为 26 件时，生产第 25 件甲种产品需要 32 万元。</div>","formulas":["\\displaystyle C(x,y)=20x+\\dfrac{\\displaystyle x^2}{\\displaystyle 4}+6y+\\dfrac{\\displaystyle y^2}{\\displaystyle 2}+10000","\\displaystyle C(24,26)=11118"],"images":[],"questionId":"q-17-1"},{"id":"b-1-15","page":"40","sourcePageIndex":1,"sourceBlockIndex":15,"role":"tex_source","text":"(17)（I）\\(\\displaystyle C(x,y)=20x+\\dfrac{\\displaystyle x^2}{\\displaystyle 4}+6y+\\dfrac{\\displaystyle y^2}{\\displaystyle 2}+10000\\)。（II）若总产量为 50 件，则当甲种产品的产量为 24 件，乙种产品的产量为 26 件时，总成本最小，最小成本为 \\(\\displaystyle C(24,26)=11118\\) 万元。（III）当总产量为 50 件且总成本最小时，甲种产品的边际成本为 32 万元。其经济意义为：当甲、乙两种产品的产量分别为 24、26 件时，若甲种产品的产量再增加 1 件，则总成本增加 32 万元，即当乙种产品的产量为 26 件时，生产第 25 件甲种产品需要 32 万元。","contentHtml":"<pre class=\"tex-source\">(17)（I）\\(\\displaystyle C(x,y)=20x+\\dfrac{\\displaystyle x^2}{\\displaystyle 4}+6y+\\dfrac{\\displaystyle y^2}{\\displaystyle 2}+10000\\)。（II）若总产量为 50 件，则当甲种产品的产量为 24 件，乙种产品的产量为 26 件时，总成本最小，最小成本为 \\(\\displaystyle C(24,26)=11118\\) 万元。（III）当总产量为 50 件且总成本最小时，甲种产品的边际成本为 32 万元。其经济意义为：当甲、乙两种产品的产量分别为 24、26 件时，若甲种产品的产量再增加 1 件，则总成本增加 32 万元，即当乙种产品的产量为 26 件时，生产第 25 件甲种产品需要 32 万元。</pre>","formulas":[],"images":[],"questionId":"q-17-1"},{"id":"b-1-16","page":"40","sourcePageIndex":1,"sourceBlockIndex":16,"role":"question","text":"(18) 证明略。","contentHtml":"<div class=\"paragraph question\">(18) 证明略。</div>","formulas":[],"images":[],"questionId":"q-18-1"},{"id":"b-1-17","page":"40","sourcePageIndex":1,"sourceBlockIndex":17,"role":"tex_source","text":"(18) 证明略。","contentHtml":"<pre class=\"tex-source\">(18) 证明略。</pre>","formulas":[],"images":[],"questionId":"q-18-1"},{"id":"b-1-18","page":"40","sourcePageIndex":1,"sourceBlockIndex":18,"role":"question","text":"(19)（I） \\(\\displaystyle f(x)=e^x\\) 。（II） \\(\\displaystyle (0,0)\\) 。","contentHtml":"<div class=\"paragraph question\">(19)（I）<span class=\"formula\" data-tex=\"\\displaystyle f(x)=e^x\" title=\"点击复制 LaTeX\">\\(\\displaystyle f(x)=e^x\\)</span>。（II）<span class=\"formula\" data-tex=\"\\displaystyle (0,0)\" title=\"点击复制 LaTeX\">\\(\\displaystyle (0,0)\\)</span>。</div>","formulas":["\\displaystyle f(x)=e^x","\\displaystyle (0,0)"],"images":[],"questionId":"q-19-1"},{"id":"b-1-19","page":"40","sourcePageIndex":1,"sourceBlockIndex":19,"role":"tex_source","text":"(19)（I）\\(\\displaystyle f(x)=e^x\\)。（II）\\(\\displaystyle (0,0)\\)。","contentHtml":"<pre class=\"tex-source\">(19)（I）\\(\\displaystyle f(x)=e^x\\)。（II）\\(\\displaystyle (0,0)\\)。</pre>","formulas":[],"images":[],"questionId":"q-19-1"},{"id":"b-1-20","page":"40","sourcePageIndex":1,"sourceBlockIndex":20,"role":"question","text":"(20)（I） \\(\\displaystyle |A|=1-a^4\\) 。（II） \\(\\displaystyle a=-1\\) 时，方程组 \\(\\displaystyle Ax=\\beta\\) 有无穷多解，其通解为 \\(\\displaystyle k(1,1,1,1)^{\\mathrm T}+(0,-1,0,0)^{\\mathrm T}\\) ，其中 \\(\\displaystyle k\\) 为任意常数。","contentHtml":"<div